Package: @PACKAGE_NAME@
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: AppleMagicTouchstream
Depends: libevdev2, udev
Description: AppleMagicTouchstream Linux runtime and device picker
 AppleMagicTouchstream turns Apple Magic Trackpads into keyboard input on Linux.
 This package installs the Linux runtime, udev permissions, user service unit,
 and optional GUI launcher when the GUI publish output is included.
